 * Step 3: Click the "Insured Information" tab
 * Step 4: Create this page object with the SAME page reference
 *
 *   const overview    = new SubmissionOverviewPage(submissionTab);
 *   await overview.clickInsuredInformationTab();
 *   const insuredPage = new InsuredInformationPage(submissionTab);
 *
 * ── WHAT YOU SEE ON SCREEN (from Image 19) ────────────────────────────────────
 *   FIRST NAMED INSURED *    [AUTOMATION-Aurora Enterprises 424]    COUNTRY * [USA]
 *   STREET ADDRESS *         [463 Main Street]
 *   STREET ADDRESS 2         [Apt 4_Q]
 *   CITY *                   [Houston]              STATE/PROVINCE * [NY - New York ▼]
 *   ZIP/POSTAL CODE *        [00320]                PROJECT NAME    [Type...]
